# NOTE: package-lock.json is intentionally NOT ignored any more.
# Committing the lockfile is what pins the transitive dependency tree, including
# the `overrides` that patch sharp/postcss/brace-expansion.
# See docs/plans/nextjs-portfolio-rewrite.md §9.6.

